--[[
    NOIR AIM SYSTEM
    Single LocalScript for a Roblox Studio experience you own or are authorized to test.

    Controls:
      Hold RMB = aim
      Release RMB = stop
      Drag title bar = move panel
      Drag slider = adjust aim strength (1-100%)

    Slider fix:
      - Uses a transparent TextButton as the actual input surface.
      - Uses the same screen-space InputObject.Position coordinates throughout.
      - Tracks the initiating mouse/touch input until it ends.
      - Keeps the visual knob non-interactive so it cannot steal slider clicks.
]]

